Package: bambaganaCI
Title: Confidence Intervals for a Population Mean
Version: 0.1.1
Authors@R: c(
    person("Silas", "Bambil", , "sbambil1@student.gsu.edu", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Yasmeen", "Babagana", email = "ybabagana1@student.gsu.edu", role = "aut")
  )
Description: Constructs percentile, basic, normal, and bias-corrected and
    accelerated bootstrap confidence intervals for a population mean.
    Provides resampled means, bootstrap standard errors, input validation,
    and readable output. Bias-corrected and accelerated intervals use the
    established boot package. Also provides standard t confidence intervals
    and common methods for extracting estimates and interval summaries.
